# drivers: the userspace device drivers. nife's own grouping: Linux ships these in the kernel.
#
# Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a package). The package's name, kind, home
# and membership are provisional, the lane's proposal for calef to ratify; the format is
# helpers/packages.py's header, and notes/package-boundaries.md has the table and the reasons.

name drivers
kind base
home drivers provisional

crate virtio
crate non_volatile_memory_express
crate jh7110_entropy

program block_driver
program serial_driver
program non_volatile_memory_express
program jh7110_entropy
